        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7504/52, Solid Brass Square Pocket Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Square Cup Pull is made out of solid brass and available in an array of not only beautiful but also popular finishes. This flush pull is pressured mounted into the door for a screw-less installation. The Solid Brass Square Pocket Door Pull is for use on sliding pocket doors and barn doors. It can also be used as a furniture pull or a lightweight kitchen cabinet pull. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/square-stainless-steel-cup-pull-omnia-7504\"><b>Stainless Steel Square Cup Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/century-solid-brass-round-flush-pull-omnia-7503-52\"><b>Solid Brass Round Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7504/52 Square Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/made-usa-logo.jpg?v=1704354497\" width=\"515\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
